    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46619" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡγηλάζω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 collat. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡγέομαι</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>guide, lead</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὸς κακὸν ἡγηλάζει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.217
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὸν μόρον ἡ.</span>
			<i>lead</i> a wretched life, <i><span class="en">
				11.618
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίοτον βαρὺν ἡ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.272
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερὸν γόον</span> Orac. ap.
				<i><span class="en">
				Zos.
				1.57
			</span></i>: for <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				893
			</span></i>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφηγηλάζω</span>
			.</div>
